  "bodyHash": "4256f83e4dcfdb78",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Universal Enchants</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 擴充了 Minecraft 的附魔系統，讓附魔能套用至更多物品，移除不必要的相容性限制，並在此過程中改善數個原版附魔。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">為什麼只有劍能獨享樂趣？將 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 套用到三叉戟 🔱、將 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 套用到弩 🏹、將 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鋒利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 套用到斧頭 🪓，或將防護類附魔套用到動物盔甲 🛡️。本模組在忠於原版玩法的同時，開啟了無數種全新的搭配可能。⚔️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了擴充相容性之外，部分附魔也獲得了實用的生活品質改進。 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 真正變得無限使用 ♾️、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幸運</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 能額外獎勵經驗值 💎、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射擊</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 效果更強大 🎯，還有更多。所有變更皆可個別設定 ⚙️，讓你打造最符合自己世界需求的附魔系統。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更多武器可獲得更多附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 斧頭、三叉戟、戰鎚、弓、弩、盾牌與其他裝備，都能獲得許多過去無法使用的現有附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">擴充遠程戰鬥：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可在弓上裝備 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射擊</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速裝填</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">；或在弩上裝備 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">力量</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">擊退</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">火焰</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">強化三叉戟與戰鎚：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可套用如 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">擊退</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鋒利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">生物剋星</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">節肢剋星</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 等附魔，打造威力強大的全新武器組合。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔動物盔甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 馬甲、狼甲與鸚鵡螺盔甲均可受惠於多種防具附魔，包含 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保護</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">摔落無傷</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">冰霜行者</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">靈魂疾行</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">荊棘</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">減少附魔互斥限制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 預設即相容熱門組合，例如 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">經驗修補</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以及 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射擊</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選傷害類附魔疊加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可設定讓 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鋒利</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">生物剋星</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">節肢剋星</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 同時生效，而非互相排斥。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選防護類附魔疊加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 允許在相同裝備上同時裝備 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保護</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">防火</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">防爆</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">彈射物保護</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">改良原版附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 不再需要備用箭矢、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幸運</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 能增加經驗掉落、</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">摔落無傷</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可防止農地被踐踏，且移除彈射物免疫後使 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多重射擊</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 更加實用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全可設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 所有相容性變更與附魔調整均可透過資料包個別啟用、停用或完全自訂。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名會依設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有模組都會具備所有類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模組隨附多個可選資料包，用於擴充現有附魔可套用的物品範圍，並啟用新的附魔組合。每個資料包專注於特定的物品群組或附魔群組，且可獨立控制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">建立世界時可於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Data Packs</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 畫面中啟用或停用這些資料包，亦可在既有世界與多人伺服器中使用 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">/datapack</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 指令進行管理。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細文件、所有隨附資料包的完整參考資訊，以及本模組提供的額外資料包功能說明，皆可於 GitHub 上的 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 檔案中找到。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-walls\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
